    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_GSETTINGS_DESKTOP_SCHEMAS
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_XKEYBOARD_CONFIG
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_EUDEV
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIBSECCOMP
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RAVIOS_ISO_CODES
    help
      GNOME Desktop support library for Wayland desktop environments.
